{
  "scope": "Twelve sequential fresh four-worker processes; three alternating pairs per workload, six seconds each. Pure private: 8192 idle rooms, one private pair. Mixed: no idle rooms, one private pair and eight reconnect workers. Both use the same frozen client, 1KiB cyclic bodies, window16, no inspection or broadcast, default IP quota disabled. Server CPUs0-3 and client CPUs4-7. Complete body/sender/FIFO/Close/EOF, independent exact counters and zero final resources. No injected failures, builds, profilers or competing workloads overlap timings. Lifecycle CPU and mixed completed work do not give a per-operation CPU comparison.",
